   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "DeepSeek-V2 config used throughout: d_model = 5120 · n_h = 128 heads · d_h = 128 · d_c = 512 (KV latent) · d'_c = 1536 (query latent) · d_R = 64 (decoupled RoPE) · L = 60 layers · 2 bytes/elem",
   "originalText": "DeepSeek-V2 config used throughout: d_model = 5120 · n_h = 128 heads · d_h = 128 · d_c = 512 (KV latent) · d'_c = 1536 (query latent) · d_R = 64 (decoupled RoPE) · L = 60 layers · 2 bytes/elem",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
