   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "symbol      meaning                              DeepSeek-V2\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nd_model     hidden size of h_t                    5120\nn_h , d_h   query heads, dim per head             128 , 128\nd_c         KV latent c^KV          (CACHED)      512 = 4·d_h\nd'_c        query latent c^Q        (not cached)  1536\nd_R         decoupled RoPE q^R, k^R (k^R CACHED)  64 = d_h/2\nL           layers                                60",
   "originalText": "symbol      meaning                              DeepSeek-V2\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nd_model     hidden size of h_t                    5120\nn_h , d_h   query heads, dim per head             128 , 128\nd_c         KV latent c^KV          (CACHED)      512 = 4·d_h\nd'_c        query latent c^Q        (not cached)  1536\nd_R         decoupled RoPE q^R, k^R (k^R CACHED)  64 = d_h/2\nL           layers                                60",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
