   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Key insight: compress each token's hidden state into ONE small latent c^KV (512) that every head\ncan decode its own K and V from, plus one tiny 64-d RoPE key. Cache = d_c + d_R = 576 numbers\nper token per layer, independent of n_h (notebook 06: cached shape (B, T, latent_dim)).",
   "originalText": "Key insight: compress each token's hidden state into ONE small latent c^KV (512) that every head\ncan decode its own K and V from, plus one tiny 64-d RoPE key. Cache = d_c + d_R = 576 numbers\nper token per layer, independent of n_h (notebook 06: cached shape (B, T, latent_dim)).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e9",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
