   "text": "MHA: K + V for 128 heads\n2·n_h·d_h = 2·128·128 = 32,768\n= 16 tiles",
   "originalText": "MHA: K + V for 128 heads\n2·n_h·d_h = 2·128·128 = 32,768\n= 16 tiles",
