  {
   "id": "e110",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1550.75,
   "width": 695.1999999999999,
   "height": 135.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1216208521,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 684213371,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KV side (h_t ∈ R^5120)\nc^KV_t = W^DKV h_t                 ∈ R^512      ← cached\nk^C_t  = W^UK c^KV_t               ∈ R^16384 → 128 heads × 128\nv^C_t  = W^UV c^KV_t               ∈ R^16384 → 128 heads × 128\nk^R_t  = RoPE_t( W^KR h_t )        ∈ R^64       ← cached, shared\nk_t,i  = [ k^C_t,i ; k^R_t ]       ∈ R^192",
   "originalText": "KV side (h_t ∈ R^5120)\nc^KV_t = W^DKV h_t                 ∈ R^512      ← cached\nk^C_t  = W^UK c^KV_t               ∈ R^16384 → 128 heads × 128\nv^C_t  = W^UV c^KV_t               ∈ R^16384 → 128 heads × 128\nk^R_t  = RoPE_t( W^KR h_t )        ∈ R^64       ← cached, shared\nk_t,i  = [ k^C_t,i ; k^R_t ]       ∈ R^192",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e111",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1080,
   "y": 1550.75,
   "width": 608.8,
   "height": 112.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2046762209,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 269490964,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Query side\nc^Q_t  = W^DQ h_t                  ∈ R^1536\nq^C_t  = W^UQ c^Q_t                ∈ R^16384 → 128 × 128\nq^R_t  = RoPE_t( W^QR c^Q_t )      ∈ R^8192  → 128 × 64\nq_t,i  = [ q^C_t,i ; q^R_t,i ]     ∈ R^192",
   "originalText": "Query side\nc^Q_t  = W^DQ h_t                  ∈ R^1536\nq^C_t  = W^UQ c^Q_t                ∈ R^16384 → 128 × 128\nq^R_t  = RoPE_t( W^QR c^Q_t )      ∈ R^8192  → 128 × 64\nq_t,i  = [ q^C_t,i ; q^R_t,i ]     ∈ R^192",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e112",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2130,
   "y": 1550.75,
   "width": 382.0,
   "height": 135.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1482823831,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1845122138,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Attention + output\no_t,i = Σ_j softmax_j( q_t,iᵀ k_j,i\n        / √(d_h + d_R) ) · v^C_j,i\n√(128 + 64) = √192 ≈ 13.86\nu_t = W^O [o_t,1 ; … ; o_t,128]\nW^O: 5120 × 16384",
   "originalText": "Attention + output\no_t,i = Σ_j softmax_j( q_t,iᵀ k_j,i\n        / √(d_h + d_R) ) · v^C_j,i\n√(128 + 64) = √192 ≈ 13.86\nu_t = W^O [o_t,1 ; … ; o_t,128]\nW^O: 5120 × 16384",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e113",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1750.75,
   "width": 3040,
   "height": 51.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1107009420,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2040590398,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
