   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e136",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2382.75,
   "width": 939.0000000000001,
   "height": 42.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1877614492,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 446574991,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trade-off: pre-multiplying W^UQ_iᵀW^UK_i would cost 1536×512×128 = 100.7 M params (vs W^UK = 8.4 M),\nso kernels usually just apply W^UK_iᵀ to q at runtime (associativity, not a new weight).",
   "originalText": "Trade-off: pre-multiplying W^UQ_iᵀW^UK_i would cost 1536×512×128 = 100.7 M params (vs W^UK = 8.4 M),\nso kernels usually just apply W^UK_iᵀ to q at runtime (associativity, not a new weight).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e135",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e137",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1604.0,
   "y": 1900.0,
   "width": 727.8000000000001,
   "height": 35.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1318703119,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 807946406,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "5 · Why RoPE breaks absorption → decoupled RoPE",
   "originalText": "5 · Why RoPE breaks absorption → decoupled RoPE",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e138",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1610.0,
   "y": 1954.0,
   "width": 716.8000000000001,
   "height": 22.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 319009743,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1362384196,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Suppose we apply RoPE to the up-projected content keys/queries as usual:",
   "originalText": "Suppose we apply RoPE to the up-projected content keys/queries as usual:",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e139",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1610.0,
   "y": 1986.5,
   "width": 830.1999999999999,
   "height": 85.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 541719408,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2051851967,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "q_t,i = R_t W^UQ_i c^Q_t ,   k_j,i = R_j W^UK_i c^KV_j          R_t, R_j: 128×128\nq_t,iᵀ k_j,i = c^Q_tᵀ W^UQ_iᵀ R_tᵀ R_j W^UK_i c^KV_j\n             = c^Q_tᵀ ( W^UQ_iᵀ R_{j−t} W^UK_i ) c^KV_j\n                        └── depends on j − t ──┘",
   "originalText": "q_t,i = R_t W^UQ_i c^Q_t ,   k_j,i = R_j W^UK_i c^KV_j          R_t, R_j: 128×128\nq_t,iᵀ k_j,i = c^Q_tᵀ W^UQ_iᵀ R_tᵀ R_j W^UK_i c^KV_j\n             = c^Q_tᵀ ( W^UQ_iᵀ R_{j−t} W^UK_i ) c^KV_j\n                        └── depends on j − t ──┘",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e140",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1610.0,
   "y": 2081.5,
   "width": 1450,
   "height": 93.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
