   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e141",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1620.0,
   "y": 2096.5,
   "width": 976.4000000000001,
   "height": 63.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 782035029,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1018232522,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Problem: the middle matrix changes with every cached position j → nothing fixed to absorb. R acts in the\n128-d head space and matrix products don't commute, so it cannot be pushed past W^UK_i onto c^KV_j.\nYou'd re-build k^C for all T cached tokens every step: 2·16384·512 ≈ 16.8 M FLOPs per token per layer.",
   "originalText": "Problem: the middle matrix changes with every cached position j → nothing fixed to absorb. R acts in the\n128-d head space and matrix products don't commute, so it cannot be pushed past W^UK_i onto c^KV_j.\nYou'd re-build k^C for all T cached tokens every step: 2·16384·512 ≈ 16.8 M FLOPs per token per layer.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e140",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e142",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1610.0,
   "y": 2191.25,
   "width": 706.9000000000001,
   "height": 22.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 263801686,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 247719778,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Fix — decoupled RoPE: give each head a separate small position channel:",
   "originalText": "Fix — decoupled RoPE: give each head a separate small position channel:",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e143",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1610.0,
   "y": 2223.75,
   "width": 983.1999999999999,
   "height": 85.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1823078164,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1048118163,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "q_t,i = [ q^C_t,i (128, no RoPE) ; q^R_t,i = RoPE_t(W^QR_i c^Q_t) (64) ]\nk_j,i = [ k^C_j,i (128, no RoPE) ; k^R_j   = RoPE_j(W^KR h_j)     (64) ]   ← shared by all heads\nscore = ( q̂_t,iᵀ c^KV_j  +  q^R_t,iᵀ k^R_j ) / √192\n          absorbed (512)     relative position: q^Rᵀ R_{j−t} k^R",
   "originalText": "q_t,i = [ q^C_t,i (128, no RoPE) ; q^R_t,i = RoPE_t(W^QR_i c^Q_t) (64) ]\nk_j,i = [ k^C_j,i (128, no RoPE) ; k^R_j   = RoPE_j(W^KR h_j)     (64) ]   ← shared by all heads\nscore = ( q̂_t,iᵀ c^KV_j  +  q^R_t,iᵀ k^R_j ) / √192\n          absorbed (512)     relative position: q^Rᵀ R_{j−t} k^R",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
