   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Key insight: MLA's cache ≈ GQA with 2.25 groups, but each of the 128 heads still gets its own\nK_i, V_i (decoded from the latent) — far richer than 2–3 shared KV heads.",
   "originalText": "Key insight: MLA's cache ≈ GQA with 2.25 groups, but each of the 128 heads still gets its own\nK_i, V_i (decoded from the latent) — far richer than 2–3 shared KV heads.",
