  {
   "id": "e254",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 3247.75,
   "width": 426.4,
   "height": 140.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 40168391,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1874335756,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "C^KV = H W^DKVᵀ    (T,5120)→(T,512)  → cache\nK^C = C^KV W^UKᵀ   (T,512)→(T,16384)\nV^C = C^KV W^UVᵀ   (T,512)→(T,16384)\nq,k: (128,T,192)   v: (128,T,128)\n→ ordinary MHA (FlashAttention)\nup-proj cost amortised over T queries;\nbig GEMMs — exactly what prefill wants",
   "originalText": "C^KV = H W^DKVᵀ    (T,5120)→(T,512)  → cache\nK^C = C^KV W^UKᵀ   (T,512)→(T,16384)\nV^C = C^KV W^UVᵀ   (T,512)→(T,16384)\nq,k: (128,T,192)   v: (128,T,128)\n→ ordinary MHA (FlashAttention)\nup-proj cost amortised over T queries;\nbig GEMMs — exactly what prefill wants",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e255",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 780,
   "y": 3247.75,
   "width": 416.8,
   "height": 140.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 945161047,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1667534282,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "q̂_t,i = W^UK_iᵀ q^C_t,i   (128 heads, 512)\nQ = [q̂ ; q^R]            (128, 576)\ncache [C^KV | K^R]       (T, 576) shared\nS = Q·cacheᵀ             (128, T) /√192\nÔ = softmax(S)·C^KV      (128, 512)\nu = Σ_i (W^O_i W^UV_i) ô_i   (5120)\n= MQA with one 576-d K head / 512-d V",
   "originalText": "q̂_t,i = W^UK_iᵀ q^C_t,i   (128 heads, 512)\nQ = [q̂ ; q^R]            (128, 576)\ncache [C^KV | K^R]       (T, 576) shared\nS = Q·cacheᵀ             (128, T) /√192\nÔ = softmax(S)·C^KV      (128, 512)\nu = Σ_i (W^O_i W^UV_i) ô_i   (5120)\n= MQA with one 576-d K head / 512-d V",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
