   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Key insight: absorbed decode reads 57× fewer bytes and does 4.25× more FLOPs than MHA per cached token\n→ AI ≈ 242 FLOP/B: above the A100 ridge (≈ 200), below H100 SXM (≈ 295). With 32 Q heads, MHA (≈1),\nGQA-8 (≈4), MQA (≈32) decode stay memory-bound; MLA decode lands near the roof (cf. FlashMLA kernels).",
   "originalText": "Key insight: absorbed decode reads 57× fewer bytes and does 4.25× more FLOPs than MHA per cached token\n→ AI ≈ 242 FLOP/B: above the A100 ridge (≈ 200), below H100 SXM (≈ 295). With 32 Q heads, MHA (≈1),\nGQA-8 (≈4), MQA (≈32) decode stay memory-bound; MLA decode lands near the roof (cf. FlashMLA kernels).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e288",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
