   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Low-rank target:  K ≈ W^UK c ,  V ≈ W^UV c ,  c = W^DKV h\n[W_K ; W_V] (2·4096 × 4096 for Llama-2-7B) ≈ U Σ Vᵀ truncated to rank d_c",
   "originalText": "Low-rank target:  K ≈ W^UK c ,  V ≈ W^UV c ,  c = W^DKV h\n[W_K ; W_V] (2·4096 × 4096 for Llama-2-7B) ≈ U Σ Vᵀ truncated to rank d_c",
