   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Problem: much more invasive than GQA conversion — RoPE must be restructured (partial RoPE), the\nfactorisation loses information, and the model must be adapted; MLA from scratch remains the clean path.",
