   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "cache/token/layer   d_c + d_R = 512 + 64 = 576   (MHA 32,768 → 1.76 %, ≈ 57×)\ndown-projections    W^DKV 512×5120 · W^DQ 1536×5120 · W^KR 64×5120\nup-projections      W^UK, W^UV 16384×512 · W^UQ 16384×1536 · W^QR 8192×1536\noutput              W^O 5120×16384\nscore               (q^Cᵀk^C + q^Rᵀk^R) / √192\nabsorb              W^UK → query side, W^UV → W^O   (decode in latent space)\nRoPE                content path RoPE-free; 64-d decoupled q^R (per head), k^R (shared)\npaper               −93.3 % KV vs DeepSeek 67B, 5.76× max generation throughput",
   "originalText": "cache/token/layer   d_c + d_R = 512 + 64 = 576   (MHA 32,768 → 1.76 %, ≈ 57×)\ndown-projections    W^DKV 512×5120 · W^DQ 1536×5120 · W^KR 64×5120\nup-projections      W^UK, W^UV 16384×512 · W^UQ 16384×1536 · W^QR 8192×1536\noutput              W^O 5120×16384\nscore               (q^Cᵀk^C + q^Rᵀk^R) / √192\nabsorb              W^UK → query side, W^UV → W^O   (decode in latent space)\nRoPE                content path RoPE-free; 64-d decoupled q^R (per head), k^R (shared)\npaper               −93.3 % KV vs DeepSeek 67B, 5.76× max generation throughput",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
